{"claim": "A test instance (rig) copied from a checkout has no camera/target/release/libcamera.so (target/ is excluded), so hotswap loads nothing and every camera command is 'No such command' (404 over the peer proxy); copy the dylib into <rig>/camera/target/release/ and restart.", "detail": "Session 3 Phase 0 (2026-11-06). FFI crates are discovered from data/camera/meta.json (cargo.ffi=true), not the generated initializer. Also: a rig's runtime/dev/repos.json may point camera at the LIVE checkout with autocommit on, so the rig's sweeper commits into the live branch; set autocommit false in every rig copy. Lab: rpicam-vid/rpicam-still shims on PATH feeding ffmpeg testsrc2 with -re (without it lavfi outruns real time).", "tags": "camera,rig,dylib,hotswap,lab,autocommit", "source": {"lib": "camera", "ctl": "camera", "facet": "js", "hash": "98eac1f8f544d515"}, "confidence": "high", "time": 1793967587378},
{"end": true}]
